    }
  ],
  "selection_reason": "Plan 1 best tests whether the Mini or Chefman provides sufficient value and whether the Premier or Impress earns its premium. It uses genuine competing offers to challenge each provider's revenue incentive while preserving the $800 complete-setup limit, seller scrutiny and all first-round purchase options. It avoids spending the final round pursuing standalone grinders that both providers report lacking.",
  "limitations": [
    "Final replies may remain selective; forecasts are qualitative, not guarantees.",
    "Reported page claims do not independently verify sellers, variants, accessories or recourse, and cannot change frozen prices.",
    "Similar listings are alternative offers, not independent confirmation; all first-round cards remain available."
  ]
